# Admin API conventions

## Module layout

```
_modules/<feature>/
  controller/   # one handler per file, exported from index.ts
  routes/       # Express router mounting controllers
  serializers/  # response shaping (when needed)
```

Register new routers in `src/app.ts`.

## Controller patterns

- Wrap handlers with `asyncHandler`
- Throw `AppError` for expected failures (404, 403, validation)
- Use `AuthenticatedRequest` + `getShopIdsForUser` / `resolveScopedShopIds` for shop-scoped resources
- List endpoints: `parseListQuery` + `paginatedResponse`

## HTTP methods

Use consistently so frontend hooks match:

| Action | Method |
|--------|--------|
| Create | POST |
| Full replace | PUT |
| Partial update | PATCH (only when route is PATCH) |
| Delete | DELETE |

When adding or changing a route, grep admin-web for the matching `usePut`/`usePatch` call.

## Schema changes

Edit `prisma/schema.prisma`, run generate/push, update seed if needed. Shared types go in `packages/shared-types` when both apps consume them.

## Tests

Add integration tests under `apps/admin-api/src/_modules/<feature>/` for new endpoints or bug fixes.
